    "summary": "This unit has 2 escape options:\n\n- As the Fight phase ends, this unit can move up to D6\" with a **fall-back move** if it is **engaged**.\n- As your opponent's turn ends, if no enemy unit is within 3\" of this unit, you can place it in **strategic reserves**. It must then make an **ingress move** during your next Movement phase, even if it is your first turn.",
